# CATALOG-BOUNDS: the Gateway catalog answers 16777217 bytes, one past fx's
# 16 MiB (`max_gateway_json_bytes`, src/gateway/client.zig:611-635), padded
# after the catalog, so its first bytes still read as one: fx refuses it
# (`GatewayJsonResponseTooLarge`, a malformed answer it does not retry,
# src/builtins/gateway.zig:2510-2533), and `/model` cannot load models.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
models p5-input-models.json
modelspad 16777217 tail
wait 4
type /model
key Enter
wait 3
snap menu
gwlog
